&lt;li&gt;Implement "enahanced telemetry reporting" (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3300355706" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7360" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7360/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7360"&gt;#7360&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Don't call &lt;code&gt;ToUpperInvariant&lt;/code&gt; if we don't need to (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3322485115" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7393" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7393/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7393"&gt;#7393&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle TypeLoadException when retrieving HostingEnvironment (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3334758375" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7417" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7417/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7417"&gt;#7417&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add missing &lt;code&gt;GetDictionary()&lt;/code&gt; method to &lt;code&gt;ConfigurationBuilder&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3337441993" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7421" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7421/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7421"&gt;#7421&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More &lt;code&gt;ConfigurationBuilder&lt;/code&gt; refactoring to avoid incorrect usages (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3337700166" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7422" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7422/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7422"&gt;#7422&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] fix: Re-use runtime metrics writer resources to limit memory growth (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3347078186" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7434" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7434/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7434"&gt;#7434&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
